Q: CSS rotating animation endless loop A: <p>try this</p>
<pre><code>&lt;style&gt;
.rotator {
  height: 1.8em;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.rotator .inner {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  animation: scroll 12s infinite linear;
}

.rotator span {
  height: 1.8em;
  line-height: 1.8em;
}

/* Number of headlines = 5 → total items = 10 */
@keyframes scroll {
  0%   { transform: translateY(0); }
  100% { transform: translateY(-50%); }
}

&lt;/style&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;rotator&quot;&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;inner&quot;&gt;
    &lt;span&gt;Headline 1&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span&gt;Headline 2&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span&gt;Headline 3&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span&gt;Headline 4&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span&gt;Headline 5&lt;/span&gt;

    &lt;!-- duplicated for seamless loop --&gt;
    &lt;span&gt;Headline 1&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span&gt;Headline 2&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span&gt;Headline 3&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span&gt;Headline 4&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span&gt;Headline 5&lt;/span&gt;


  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</code></pre>
